         <title>CCDASTRO Master Workflow 0.2.0</title>
         <description>
            <p>A launch-only session planner for existing calibration, registration, integration and channel-combination tools. Includes mono LRGB/Ha/OIII/SII, OSC, OSC with filter sessions and OSC with mono narrowband data. Folder entries are a checklist, not automatic tool inputs. No processing runs automatically.</p>
         </description>
